h></svg></button></div></div></h3><p>Beyond "AHA" moments mentioned in the =
DeepSeek-R1 paper, RL has been shown to induce valuable self-verification a=
nd reflective reasoning capabilities in models [2] [9]. Interestingly, simi=
lar to the AHA moment, these capabilities emerged naturally during training=
 without explicit instruction.</p><p>[1] Showed that extending context leng=
ths (up to 128k tokens) further improves the model's self-reflection and se=
lf-correction capabilities.</p><h3 class=3D"header-anchor-post"><strong>4. =
