th d=3D"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></pat=
h></svg></button></div></div></h3><p>Most research efforts so far has focus=
ed on reasoning tasks in math or coding contexts. However, [4] demonstrated=
 successful generalization by training models on logic puzzles. And models =
trained on logic puzzles also achieved strong performance in mathematical r=
easoning tasks. This is evidence for RL's ability to induce general reasoni=
ng behaviors independent of specific domain knowledge.</p><h3 class=3D"head=
er-anchor-post"><strong>5. Extensions to broader domains</strong><div class=
